(LEGAL-007 - OPERATIVE CLAUSES & STATUTORY DIRECTIVES \(PAGE 2\)) Tj T*
(Title: Tamil Nadu Land Encroachment Act, 1905 \(Act III of 1905\)  Water-Course Por) Tj T*
(Addressed / Competent Officer: Revenue Tahsildar & Revenue Divisional Officer \(RDO\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(CLAUSE 1: Section 2 & Section 7 \(Prior Notice on Eri Poramboke\)) Tj T*
(Under Section 2, all beds of tanks \(Eri Poramboke\), supply channels, and bunds are) Tj T*
(the absolute property of the Government. Section 7 requires the Tahsildar or) Tj T*
(Deputy Tahsildar to serve a show-cause notice before passing a Section 6 eviction) Tj T*
(order on non-WRD Panchayat Union tanks.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(CLAUSE 2: Section 6 \(Summary Eviction & Forfeiture\)) Tj T*
(Under Section 6, any person unauthorisedly occupying Eri Poramboke or Odai) Tj T*
(\(stream\) land shall be summarily evicted by the Collector or Tahsildar, and any) Tj T*
(building or construction erected thereon is liable to forfeiture and demolition.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
